  "goodToKnow": "Der Liebhaber (die Liebhaberin) is a lover in a romantic sense, often secret, but also an enthusiast: ein Kunstliebhaber, Für Liebhaber! (for connoisseurs). Der Liebhaberpreis is a collector's price, higher than usual. From liebhaben (to be fond of). In theatre, der jugendliche Liebhaber was the role of the young romantic lead. Die Liebhaberei is a hobby done for love, not money."
